[thin] Specific fitted M3 insert-host interface: these sections span 2.000 mm from the Ø4.0 pilot to the Ø8 host's face (mount_boss_dia), ruthex's 1.6 mm minimum wall plus the 0.25 mm supported allowance and 0.15 mm slip. Each measured face sits on a neighbour: relay 1 and 2 pin boxes, the ground stack, the main board's top edge. Inside a fill the host keeps the fill's face, 1.75 mm behind the relieved crown.
alternatives: A 3 mm host needs every body gap in the bay widened by about 1 mm and relays with pins further from their holes.
