[ceiling] Unavoidable populated-electronics mounting profiles: these finite pad ends retain their component mounting planes and insert hosts, with corbel reach limited by the actual pin/blocker fields. Support approaches through the empty interior before electronics installation. Physical cleanup remains unqualified.
alternatives: An unrestricted corbel enters the populated-board/tail keepout. Shortening changes the insert host or mounting plane; a different layout needs its own full populated clearance review.
